### Дополнительный турнир для заявки (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Заявки CRUD", "teamLimit": 2}

> {% client.global.set("extraTournamentId", response.body.id); %}

### Создать заявку (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId": {{teamOneId}}, "tournamentId": {{extraTournamentId}}}

> {% client.global.set("applicationId", response.body.id); %}

### Все заявки (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!

### Заявка по id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!

### Отклонить заявку через PATCH (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "REJECTED"}

### Удалить заявку (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Удалить дополнительный турнир (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{extraTournamentId}}
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Подать заявку на основной турнир (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId": {{teamOneId}}, "tournamentId": {{tournamentId}}}

> {% client.global.set("applicationOneId", response.body.id); %}

### Допустить команду (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications/{{applicationOneId}}/approve
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Подать заявку на основной турнир (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/team-applications
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId": {{teamTwoId}}, "tournamentId": {{tournamentId}}}

