### Создать дополнительный матч (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/matches
Authorization: Basic organizer@tournament.local Organize2026!
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tournamentId": {{tournamentId}}, "team1Id": {{teamOneId}}, "team2Id": {{teamTwoId}}}

> {% client.global.set("matchId", response.body.id); %}

